{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/7/2a7b8f07a2d6ab128952c1f25c6f80a18d651ca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=(x-a)^2+(x-b)^2, a, b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"215\" height=\"19\" /> constants. For what value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> a minimum?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/2/6a26eb32aff42518ac59f231712c133e8b6c51d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{a+b}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ a+b \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\sqrt{ab} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\sqrt{\\frac{a^2+b^2}{2}}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{a+b}{2ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"538\" height=\"43\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expanding the quadratic and collecting terms gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/f/18f725587fb6ef6250d5d851b81658ef8e1f8128.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2x^2 - (2a + 2b)x + (a^2+b^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"254\" height=\"19\" />.  For a quadratic of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/e/e7e1240ba67df85ddbea95d21628aabc34eb7d6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = Ax^2 + Bx + C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/0/eb001e159d217dfa81bfe9eae4456cbbb928d9c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is minimized when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/9/829c1bfc4236c5ccc0aec50c855ff4279ae550ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -\\frac{B}{2A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"74\" height=\"37\" />, which is the average of the roots.\n</p><p>Thus, the quadratic is minimized when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/8/5b84e2d09b443854ed27df78d593bcaea94fa63f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{2a+2b}{2\\cdot 2} = \\frac{a+b}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"162\" height=\"37\" />, which is answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The problem should return real values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/b/29b0525fee26c4d7925ab8246fbe737d53df2902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 0$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/c/05cf55f7aad8bb333e5c34b1da312ab786c7bcfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" />, which eliminates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.  We want to distinguish between options <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff2a44a8501da3e1638aa408870d92b5a72f095.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B, D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" />, and testing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/8/1380569da9f44be4d7928219f932ac46c950e879.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b) = (2, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> should do that, as answers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff2a44a8501da3e1638aa408870d92b5a72f095.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B, D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" /> will turn into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/0/fb0525e903fc7004cc82ccbce7c00ab8272e6dfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, \\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"20\" />, respectively.\n</p><p>PLugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/8/1380569da9f44be4d7928219f932ac46c950e879.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b) = (2, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/1/b21def2cf6020ca4a6aa055efd0b0124eb1ae233.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = (x - 2)^2 + x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"19\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/d/69d7448124bc59e75b39e0edac2819b30ef4ee90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2x^2 - 4x + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" />.  This has a minimum at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/e/86e3bf0386fc1eec1762402b25a659cd87ef13c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -\\frac{-4}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"74\" height=\"37\" />, or at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />.  This is answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index